  "all_registered_checks_pass": true,
  "restricted_conclusion": "No non-repetition two-witness code with more than one trace value uniquely corrects one arbitrary whole-witness substitution. Any apparent two-witness escape changes the error model or adds further trusted/internal witness resources. This conditional coding result does not derive the error model from core identity."
